# 2025-06-07  2.4.4    mrosiere pbcc         : add logical name option
# 2025-09-22  2.5.0    mrosiere pbcc/regtool : use Makefile
# 2025-11-02  2.5.1    mrosiere regtool      : fix init value
# 2025-11-05  2.5.2    mrosiere Generators   : Use logger
